==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Oldhorn]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[M. Ost]] spawns.

==Strategy ==
Defeat the 2 Kang Roos with a cat with the Double Bounty talent, so as to fill your wallet quickly. Use [[:Category:Anti-Relic Cats|anti-Relics]] such as [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Rodeo Cat]] with Target Relic talents and [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]] against the Relic enemies. Also, bring some other attackers like [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]] to deal with Rain D. There is no backliner support so this stage is straightforward.

